<title>JAPAN: Fuji Heavy files 60 bln yen shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Fuji Heavy files 60 bln yen shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuji Heavy Industries Ltd filed a shelf registration with the Finance Ministry to issue up to 60 billion yen worth of corporate bonds, effective for two years from May 6, the ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Fuji Heavy was not immediately available for comment due to company holidays this week.</p>
